            {
              "id": "7cf908bc-79a2-4fd7-af41-9713f35c38d9",
              "name": "body",
              "value": "=Dear {{ $json['First Name'] }},<br><br>We noticed you weren't able to make it to your {{ $json['Appointment Type'] }} appointment on {{ $json['Appointment Date'] }} — no worries at all! We know life gets busy.<br><br>Your dental health is important to us, and we'd love to get you rescheduled at a time that works better for you.<br><br>You can call us at {{ $json['Clinic Phone'] }} or simply reply to this email to book a new appointment.<br><br>We look forward to seeing you soon!<br><br>Warm regards,<br>The {{ $json['Clinic Name'] }} Team",
